[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8941.67, "timestamp": "02:29:01", "text": "而且我确实确保点赞了联系方式。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8946.63, "timestamp": "02:29:06", "text": "就像今天的老师之类的。呃，还有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8949.19, "timestamp": "02:29:09", "text": "老师说，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8951.83, "timestamp": "02:29:11", "text": "对我们所有人来说，这简直是晴天霹雳。没想到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8954.309, "timestamp": "02:29:14", "text": "这种情况就像被拒绝一样发生。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8958.07, "timestamp": "02:29:18", "text": "东西。他们问那个人，呃，学生"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8961.75, "timestamp": "02:29:21", "text": "呃，我的同班同学，他当时去了日本。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8965.19, "timestamp": "02:29:25", "text": "去年四月。他当时说：“是啊，呃，这个。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8968.469, "timestamp": "02:29:28", "text": "一周前我们接到了通知，我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8970.95, "timestamp": "02:29:30", "text": "不知道他们这么做的真正原因"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8974.389, "timestamp": "02:29:34", "text": "被拒绝之类的。” 是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8976.23, "timestamp": "02:29:36", "text": "可能涉及一些政治问题，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8979.67, "timestamp": "02:29:39", "text": "要知道，那种事也会发生。真的。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8981.91, "timestamp": "02:29:41", "text": "事情发生了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8986.309, "timestamp": "02:29:46", "text": "是的。还有课程那件事，呃……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8989.27, "timestamp": "02:29:49", "text": "老师说这件事还在讨论中。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8992.07, "timestamp": "02:29:52", "text": "尚未证实。所以，我可能确实这么做了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8994.23, "timestamp": "02:29:54", "text": "还要告诉他我有考试。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8996.309, "timestamp": "02:29:56", "text": "我希望我能跟上课程。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8999.429, "timestamp": "02:29:59", "text": "事情七月份就开始了，这样我就可以集中精力了。"}]